  "template_by_type": {
    "capital": "capital", "city": "city", "port": "port",
    "town": "town", "village": "town", "outpost": "town", "fortress": "town"
  },
  "generation": {
    "$comment": "隨機格子。wild = 城鎮近郊；dungeon = 冒險區域的四層（周邊、淺層、中層、深層）。數量為 [最少, 最多]。step_minutes 為每走一格花費的時間。",
